{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "6c1864816ba9514daea618354a0563546668ea5a7939e54df0a0ff85d6dc6803", "ja": "もちろん、お家でも繰り返し見てほしいのですよ。\n見どころは……全部！なのです♪", "zh": "当然也希望大家在家里反复观看哦。\n看点嘛……全部！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "ea6739745e3293e5322cba59f0e69c3386ed9362f0e22c1a2aea200d52aaf769", "ja": "私は主人公の、アシュリーという役を演じました。\n楽しんでもらえたら、うれしいです。", "zh": "我饰演的是主角阿什莉。要是大家能喜欢，我会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "2ba88f8640cd6e9c32c32dd13794adbf43d67e5715db2a5e0ac1b70c0483c4bb", "ja": "私は、志保ちゃん演じるアシュリーの敵……かしら？\nオスカー役です。アシュリー、本当に可愛いのよね。", "zh": "我是志保饰演的阿什莉的敌人……应该算是吧？我饰演的是奥斯卡。阿什莉真的很可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "dd150e3ff9941d670f57d0a6990686474830152af51b462c5643eaa8c793f7c6", "ja": "姫の演じたアリエルは、オスカーの従兄弟で、\nアシュリーのことをライバル視しているのです！", "zh": "公主扮演的爱丽儿是奥斯卡的表兄弟，\n把阿什利视为了竞争对手哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "05b9ba82e3a97febc4f5f360579a48c11ee6beab7e0cdf273c48f557c9d72d8e", "ja": "私は、アシュリーのルームメイトのハーヴェイで……\n暴走するアシュリーくんを止めるのが、大変でした。", "zh": "我是阿什莉的室友哈维……\n要阻止失控的阿什莉，真是费了不少劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "ce201a8b40e8037cb510e002822364b34ecba2e90492b0361caf020942955609", "ja": "クスクス……", "zh": "呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "22636c68506811fb50cdb3c11230691b658a5fe06a6a477af9058990bece0a55", "ja": "歌織さん……琴葉さんも。\nみんな、すぐ私のことをからかいますよね。", "zh": "歌织小姐……琴叶小姐也是。\n大家总是马上就来捉弄我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "1f2a254c730d11faac90c37db754947f9361003a0450dedc2f2c5401f17556f8", "ja": "からかってなんかないのです！\n姫は本気なのですよ！", "zh": "才没有在捉弄你呢！\n本公主是认真的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "fdc59953b339529fbb5a13706912206e5aad98e73bc2f1e2b432e6197189fbd0", "ja": "姫もアシュリーみたいに、ちやほやされて、\nキラキラなプロポーズをされてみたいのです～。", "zh": "公主也想和阿什莉一样被人众星捧月，\n被闪闪发光地求婚呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "d5cf7bf5adab5eb2821f8aa82306fdb8d9e52f12785b9b5dd0edd677cc5cca13", "ja": "本気って、そっち……？", "zh": "你说的认真，是指那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "71866f7aa8187c6adb4307c48fdd7bb029f851c86ff66e671c1758543a9d1f86", "ja": "だったら、ここでやってみるのはどうかしら？\n……んっ、んんっ。", "zh": "既然这样，要不要就在这里试试看？\n……嗯，嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "d0b9795a5cf23c83a0790517edfe3ade258aa371211fe83c196def76644a6945", "ja": "「アリエル……いや、まつりちゃん。君こそが、\n僕のお姫様だ。どうか僕と……結婚してくれないか？」", "zh": "“爱丽儿……不，茉莉。你才是\n我的公主殿下。请问你……愿意嫁给我吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1016_audience", "source_sha256": "176ebe3dae54870b68b0fbbb7981e9363c4f053851c1626bf175d5472de864f1", "ja": "キャァアアアア！！！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "cf7ca1a0a9da12dd44b1f81834f4f3ef460c03da36185d00eff07e52a2ce0a30", "ja": "歌織さん、いきなり即興で……すごい。", "zh": "歌织姐，突然就即兴发挥……好厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "e635784cd729fb4d5f2b2645f847b3da5aaf13865b3b16903ac4692f55da782d", "ja": "歌織ちゃんの生オスカー、わんだほー！なのです！\n姫もみんなも、ドキドキなのです～！", "zh": "歌织的现场奥斯卡，太棒啦！  \n姬和大家都心怦怦跳的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "d59cecbd50c73da6d8d4ac6578cde3dce0720d3c923963a3af37e106565134d5", "ja": "男性も、驚くと『キャー』っていうんですね……\nあ、すみません。なんでもないです。", "zh": "原来男性受到惊吓时，也会发出“呀——”的叫声啊……\n啊，抱歉。没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "a9ee2acf507448dac94ed86fdfcbb62fb60b548d89bcee667e3c9f8099fa0b88", "ja": "「おや。君も、遊んでほしいのかい？」", "zh": "“哎呀。你也想跟我一起玩吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "9a8142f1ae0ab7547d2741e6a45f585619cd4e4158d6ef4a2f3955be9ad973a3", "ja": "えっ。わ、私！？", "zh": "欸？我、我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "c7e60864a0d29e5e8f57680079b710a903f505f3c030fb244ef0ea04e8785bc4", "ja": "「君だって、こういうのは嫌いではないと思うけど。\n……さあ、遠慮しないでおいで？」", "zh": "“我想你其实也不会讨厌这种事吧。\n……来，别客气，快过来？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "a7318c918171d8945345853601fcdf8e7adf05c4a78f5125974a22a54a258150", "ja": "そ、そうですね……わかりました！\nでは、私も……んんっ。", "zh": "是、是啊……我明白了！\n那么，我也……嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "3ea23a4790791d5cf0b03fe2b2aef837ac520dfeb57b5009bb8180890d6a5c42", "ja": "「まつりちゃん。どうか僕に、君を守らせてほしい。\n君のためなら、強くなれるから……」", "zh": "「茉莉。请务必让我来保护你。\n为了你，我能变得更加坚强……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "1d1d0353a774eb31c709f35197d17eb09eaf634b03b492e2213b990ee1a7e006", "ja": "わんだほー！！！　ハーヴェイらしい告白なのです！\nふたりとも、さすがなのです～！", "zh": "太精彩了！！！真有哈维风格的告白呢！\n你们两位都好厉害呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "ae2cb73d7971a1a2cbd4c2bf4795c7303c7dbdd73749fe3c2c4f1eee4712300b", "ja": "それじゃ、次は志保ちゃんの番ね。", "zh": "那么，接下来轮到志保了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b3a873ca27cefffb8e767daca58f269225265c1247c33bb6194d04a6208c0f3", "ja": "私もですか？", "zh": "我也要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "b9d977d5057219a3131c12801f49bbb671da5962f8fde54881a762cc1d309ebe", "ja": "準備が必要なのです？　ならその間に、\n姫と琴葉ちゃんで、歌織ちゃんにお返しするのです！", "zh": "需要准备吗？那就趁这段时间，由本公主和琴叶给歌织回礼吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "67ec0e003363bc2d333284a6c01d4b9c3c5a91b3ca09afdf8fb3eb89bfb86392", "ja": "「君は僕を、子どもだと思っているな？　……生憎、\n大人になる準備は、とっくの昔にできているんだ」", "zh": "“你把我看成小孩子了吧？……真不巧，\n变成大人的准备，我早就已经做好了。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "c2c9a0af5bcc12ef7a3f3308592ac52b6fb20f44a14b926958e663c4a2c0fdc0", "ja": "「僕には、あなたが必要なんです。\nどうか僕と、ずっと一緒にいてください」", "zh": "「我需要你。\n请你务必和我永远在一起」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "ec4639c43c5f78946b99ea7856a7e25c92f6621d646a72f4ded02776b01f25d4", "ja": "「彼女は、僕と一緒になる運命なんだ！」", "zh": "她注定要和我在一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "1dbc400418869c9ae4875030c35b780961109263427530e54435da6da970d1fe", "ja": "「抜け駆けなんて許さないよ！」", "zh": "「我可不许你抢跑偷跑哦！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "935805df6f9d714c75185316b7af236d6a7ea45d903346a937377dc37c04aee2", "ja": "まあ……！　ケンカが始まってしまったわ。\nどうしましょう、志保ちゃん！", "zh": "哎呀……！大家吵起来了。\n这可怎么办，志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "166916abcb6661d08bd7c7168867b557ae75dff82497aa97264a4e9a744d10a6", "ja": "え、ええと……\n「みんな、ケンカはやめるんだ！」", "zh": "呃、那个……\n“大家，别再吵架了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_024_os_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_024_os_01_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "872b484973c2363a766e00eafcd90b48c1dbae22f0a24d50705aaf450c697fbf", "ja": "……「君は、大切なお姫様なんだ。僕の\n知らないところでケガなんてしたら、許さない」", "zh": "……“你可是我珍视的公主。要是背着我在我不知道的地方受了伤，我可不会原谅你。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
